      "description": "paper-trading-realism phase-4: per-book quantiles of paper_mid_fill_bias_bps = signed (new ask/bid fill - old mid \u00b1 5bps fill) / mid * 10_000. Positive = the phase-4 model costs the book MORE than the pre-phase-4 model would have (you now pay the real spread). Expected P50 ~= (spread_bps - 10)/2 per symbol: if P50 spread was 12bps, P50 bias should be ~1bps; if P50 spread was 5bps, P50 bias should be slightly negative (rare \u2014 phase-4 is cheaper than legacy only when half-spread < 5bps).",
